('P5DAT06-D01','P5-DAT-06','diagnostic','P5 Representation of data','P5-DAT-06','easy','mcq','The data are 1, 2, 2, 6, 9. What is the mean?','["4", "2", "20", "5"]','A','The total is 20 and there are 5 values, so the mean is 20 ÷ 5 = 4.','Даны значения 1, 2, 2, 6, 9. Чему равно среднее арифметическое?','Ma’lumotlar: 1, 2, 2, 6, 9. O‘rtacha arifmetik qiymat nechaga teng?','The data are 1, 2, 2, 6, 9. What is the mean?','["4", "2", "20", "5"]','["4", "2", "20", "5"]','["4", "2", "20", "5"]','Сумма равна 20, значений 5, поэтому среднее равно 20 ÷ 5 = 4.','Yig‘indi 20, qiymatlar soni 5, shuning uchun o‘rtacha 20 ÷ 5 = 4.','The total is 20 and there are 5 values, so the mean is 20 ÷ 5 = 4.','ExamPrep:P5:p5_repr_beta_v1:P5DAT06-D01',50,''),
('P5DAT06-L01','P5-DAT-06','learning','P5 Representation of data','P5-DAT-06','easy','mcq','The ordered data are 5, 7, 7, 8, 13. What is the median?','["5", "7", "8", "13"]','B','There are five ordered values, so the median is the middle (third) value, 7.','Упорядоченные данные: 5, 7, 7, 8, 13. Чему равна медиана?','Tartiblangan ma’lumotlar: 5, 7, 7, 8, 13. Mediana nechaga teng?','The ordered data are 5, 7, 7, 8, 13. What is the median?','["5", "7", "8", "13"]','["5", "7", "8", "13"]','["5", "7", "8", "13"]','Есть пять упорядоченных значений, поэтому медиана — среднее по положению, третье значение: 7.','Beshta tartiblangan qiymat bor, shuning uchun mediana o‘rtadagi (uchinchi) qiymat, ya’ni 7.','There are five ordered values, so the median is the middle (third) value, 7.','ExamPrep:P5:p5_repr_beta_v1:P5DAT06-L01',45,''),
('P5DAT06-L02','P5-DAT-06','learning','P5 Representation of data','P5-DAT-06','medium','input','Grouped data have frequencies 1, 2, 1 in the intervals 0 ≤ x < 10, 10 ≤ x < 20, 20 ≤ x < 30 respectively. Using class midpoints, enter the estimated mean.','[]','15','Midpoints are 5, 15 and 25. The estimated mean is (1·5 + 2·15 + 1·25)/4 = 60/4 = 15.','Сгруппированные данные имеют частоты 1, 2, 1 в интервалах 0 ≤ x < 10, 10 ≤ x < 20, 20 ≤ x < 30 соответственно. Используя середины интервалов, введите оценку среднего.','Guruhlangan ma’lumotlarda 0 ≤ x < 10, 10 ≤ x < 20, 20 ≤ x < 30 intervallaridagi chastotalar mos ravishda 1, 2, 1. Interval o‘rtalaridan foydalanib, taxminiy o‘rtachani kiriting.','Grouped data have frequencies 1, 2, 1 in the intervals 0 ≤ x < 10, 10 ≤ x < 20, 20 ≤ x < 30 respectively. Using class midpoints, enter the estimated mean.','[]','[]','[]','Середины интервалов: 5, 15 и 25. Оценка среднего: (1·5 + 2·15 + 1·25)/4 = 60/4 = 15.','Interval o‘rtalari 5, 15 va 25. Taxminiy o‘rtacha: (1·5 + 2·15 + 1·25)/4 = 60/4 = 15.','Midpoints are 5, 15 and 25. The estimated mean is (1·5 + 2·15 + 1·25)/4 = 60/4 = 15.','ExamPrep:P5:p5_repr_beta_v1:P5DAT06-L02',70,''),
('P5DAT06-L03','P5-DAT-06','learning','P5 Representation of data','P5-DAT-06','easy','mcq','The data are 3, 4, 4, 4, 9, 12. What is the mode?','["3", "4", "6", "12"]','B','The value 4 occurs most often, so the mode is 4.','Даны значения 3, 4, 4, 4, 9, 12. Чему равна мода?','Ma’lumotlar: 3, 4, 4, 4, 9, 12. Moda nechaga teng?','The data are 3, 4, 4, 4, 9, 12. What is the mode?','["3", "4", "6", "12"]','["3", "4", "6", "12"]','["3", "4", "6", "12"]','Значение 4 встречается чаще всего, поэтому мода равна 4.','4 qiymati eng ko‘p uchraydi, shuning uchun moda 4.','The value 4 occurs most often, so the mode is 4.','ExamPrep:P5:p5_repr_beta_v1:P5DAT06-L03',45,''),
('P5DAT06-R01','P5-DAT-06','retest','P5 Representation of data','P5-DAT-06','medium','input','The data are 6, 8, 8, 9, 14. Enter the mean.','[]','9','The total is 45, so the mean is 45 ÷ 5 = 9.','Даны значения 6, 8, 8, 9, 14. Введите среднее арифметическое.','Ma’lumotlar: 6, 8, 8, 9, 14. O‘rtacha arifmetik qiymatni kiriting.','The data are 6, 8, 8, 9, 14. Enter the mean.','[]','[]','[]','Сумма равна 45, поэтому среднее равно 45 ÷ 5 = 9.','Yig‘indi 45, shuning uchun o‘rtacha 45 ÷ 5 = 9.','The total is 45, so the mean is 45 ÷ 5 = 9.','ExamPrep:P5:p5_repr_beta_v1:P5DAT06-R01',50,''),
('P5DAT06-R02','P5-DAT-06','retest','P5 Representation of data','P5-DAT-06','medium','input','Grouped data have frequencies 2, 4, 2 in the intervals 0 ≤ x < 4, 4 ≤ x < 8, 8 ≤ x < 12. Using class midpoints, enter the estimated mean.','[]','6','Midpoints are 2, 6 and 10. The estimated mean is (2·2 + 4·6 + 2·10)/8 = 48/8 = 6.','Сгруппированные данные имеют частоты 2, 4, 2 в интервалах 0 ≤ x < 4, 4 ≤ x < 8, 8 ≤ x < 12. Используя середины интервалов, введите оценку среднего.','Guruhlangan ma’lumotlarda 0 ≤ x < 4, 4 ≤ x < 8, 8 ≤ x < 12 intervallaridagi chastotalar 2, 4, 2. Interval o‘rtalaridan foydalanib, taxminiy o‘rtachani kiriting.','Grouped data have frequencies 2, 4, 2 in the intervals 0 ≤ x < 4, 4 ≤ x < 8, 8 ≤ x < 12. Using class midpoints, enter the estimated mean.','[]','[]','[]','Середины интервалов: 2, 6 и 10. Оценка среднего: (2·2 + 4·6 + 2·10)/8 = 48/8 = 6.','Interval o‘rtalari 2, 6 va 10. Taxminiy o‘rtacha: (2·2 + 4·6 + 2·10)/8 = 48/8 = 6.','Midpoints are 2, 6 and 10. The estimated mean is (2·2 + 4·6 + 2·10)/8 = 48/8 = 6.','ExamPrep:P5:p5_repr_beta_v1:P5DAT06-R02',70,''))
